    DESCRIPTION = 'The bv_ship_mode view provides detailed information about various shipping modes used in logistics and transportation. It includes fields such as a unique identifier for each shipping mode, shipping mode identifiers, types of shipping services, codes representing different shipment methods, carriers involved in the delivery process, and contractual agreements related to shipping. This structured data facilitates efficient tracking and management of shipping options, allowing businesses to categorize and process shipments effectively. The bv_ship_mode view could be utilized for analyzing and optimizing shipping strategies, helping businesses select appropriate shipping methods based on speed, type, and carrier while managing contracts efficiently.'
