        ws_net_profit:decimal (sourcetypeid = '3', sourcetyperadix = '10', sourcetypedecimals = '2', sourcetypesize = '7', description = 'Represents the profit made from the sale after all costs, taxes, and discounts, essential for assessing business performance.')
    )
    FOLDER = '/1 - connectivity/2 - base views'
    DESCRIPTION = 'The bv_web_sales view provides a comprehensive overview of web sales transactions, capturing critical aspects such as the sale date and time, shipping details, customer information, and financial metrics. Key fields include identifiers for sold items, customer demographics, billing and shipping addresses, and various sales and cost amounts. With this data, it becomes possible to analyze sales trends over time, assess customer behavior, and manage logistics effectively. The view incorporates data from different dimensions, allowing for detailed insights into inventory management, promotional effectiveness, and overall profitability. This view could be used to analyze sales performance on the web, understand customer demographics and behavior, evaluate the effectiveness of promotions, and optimize logistics and inventory management.'
